title: "[Beslisboom] ExceptionHandlerPattern.Rewrite" {shape: text; near: top-center; style: {font-size: 24; bold: true}}
direction: down
q1: "Abstract of Handle\nniet in deze klasse?" {shape: diamond}
q2: "Expliciete interface-\nimplementatie?" {shape: diamond}
q3: "async, geen blok-body\nof niet 4 parameters?" {shape: diamond}
q4: "Elk gebruik van state is\nstate.SetHandled(x); return ...;?" {shape: diamond}
q5: "Elke return is\nTask.CompletedTask?" {shape: diamond}
q6: "Al een basisklasse?" {shape: diamond}
m1: "Manual: abstract / Handle elders\n(geen proof)"
m2: "Manual: explicit interface\n(geen proof)"
m3: "Manual: async of geen statement body\n(geen proof)"
m4: "Manual: state is used other than\n(state-passed)"
m5: "Manual: not Task.CompletedTask\n(geen proof)"
m6: "Manual: already has a base class\n(geen proof)"
f: "MessageExceptionHandler + new(Handled(x)) / new(NotHandled)\n(set-handled)"
q1 -> m1: ja
q1 -> q2: nee
q2 -> m2: ja
q2 -> q3: nee
q3 -> m3: ja
q3 -> q4: nee
q4 -> m4: nee
q4 -> q5: ja
q5 -> m5: nee
q5 -> q6: ja
q6 -> m6: ja
q6 -> f: nee
